  "notes": "Lines numbered as in Audio/VirginMary.json (1-48). Four verse+chorus rounds of twelve lines. Verse lines pass between groups (trios, then left/middle/right pairs, trios again, then outer/middle/inner pairs), everyone on the fourth line. Choruses are call and response: the caller sings the glory lines and the first oh-yes, the answering group the kingdom lines and the second; everyone on the last line. Callers/answers: A/B, outer pair/middle four, B/A, odd/even. Looks: Caribbean warm colours (orange, sunshine yellow, hibiscus pink, turquoise): chases, marquees with colour hits, plasma, butterflies, spirals, choir-wide spiral and butterfly; resting trees watch the singers."
